@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@jwt = {{jwt}}
@requestId = {{requestId}}

### Reporte legacy de alertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/alerts?from=2026-05-01T00:00:00&to=2026-05-12T23:59:59&type=LOW_BATTERY&status=PENDIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Reporte paginado de alertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/alerts/page?from=2026-05-01T00:00:00&to=2026-05-12T23:59:59&type=LOW_BATTERY&status=PENDIENTE&page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt&direction=DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

